WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.071
The world is driven by rich, complex data streams with industries ranging from finance,

00:00:05.071 --> 00:00:07.540
which tracks real-time changes in the stock market, 

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:15.348
to online gaming, which collects live data about player-game interactions,
 all dependent on the ability to stream data.

00:00:15.348 --> 00:00:21.588
As the demand for faster data processing increases, 
data streaming is becoming the default skill for data engineers.

00:00:21.588 --> 00:00:26.126
The new Data Streaming Nanodegree Program 
from Udacity will help you stay on the cutting edge.

00:00:26.126 --> 00:00:30.497
At Udacity, you’ll learn by doing and will complete real-world projects. 

00:00:30.497 --> 00:00:35.335
You’ll build fluency in modern data engineering 
tools and learn to process data in real-time 

00:00:35.335 --> 00:00:38.938
using Apache Spark, Kafka, KSQL, and more!

00:00:38.938 --> 00:00:46.279
The projects don’t just give you real-world streaming experience; 
you can also use them to create a portfolio showcasing your skills to prospective employers! 

00:00:46.279 --> 00:00:53.620
You'll learn from the very best in the business; 
our instructors include senior data engineers at SpotHero and Change HealthCare.

00:00:53.620 --> 00:01:00.393
Udacity’s Data Streaming Nanodegree program teaches you to develop
 systems and applications capable of interpreting data in real-time!

00:01:00.393 --> 00:01:06.833
The skills you learn will help you upskill for your current role 
or help you land a job in industries

00:01:06.833 --> 00:01:12.372
from web personalization to fraud detection, 
and from health monitoring to supply chain maintenance!

00:01:12.372 --> 00:01:15.141
Sign up for Udacity’s Data Streaming Nanodegree program today!

